Foodie's business and support email is **finn.foodieapp@gmail.com**, under the name Finlay Turnquist. Use it anywhere Foodie shows a contact:
- the privacy policy and terms of use (docs/),
- `FoodieLinks.supportEmail` in SettingsView.swift (Contact Support),
